# `S-2a` (tflw `M240`; `PLAN_M239_DOGFOOD_EXPANSION.md` §3) — `tflw ui`, tested in its own language.
#
# **Its own config root, in a dot-directory, for the reason `tflw-acceptance/conformance/` has one.**
# The page is not the storefront: under this repository's `tflw.config` every `open` here would
# resolve against `webV2`, and `tflw run`'s discovery skips a dot-directory, so the ordinary suite
# never meets these files. `scripts/verify-ui-page.mjs` is the one thing that runs them: it serves a
# scratch copy of this project with `tflw ui`, copies this directory beside it, and runs it there
# with the two variables below set from the server's first line — so the page's writes land in the
# copy and its report never lands in this tree.
#
# The base is a plain override (`M197`, `D1024`), never redacted, because a port is not a secret;
# the token is read with `env(…)` inside each test, which the redactor hides wherever it appears.
# The token changes with every server start, so a run without it is a run against nothing; declared
# here so a missing one refuses the run before the first step rather than failing at it (`TF077`).
require env TFLW_UI_TOKEN

env local default
  web env TFLW_UI_URL default "http://127.0.0.1:4799"
  api env TFLW_UI_URL default "http://127.0.0.1:4799"
  authorized target env TFLW_UI_URL default "http://127.0.0.1:4799" reason "the tflw ui server verify-ui-page.mjs starts on a scratch copy and stops after"
